# ERI §10: "Demonstration content should be used only with consent, and sample
# media should be used for the hackathon." A recording of a real person must
# never end up in this repo by accident, so the formats a camera or microphone
# produces are refused outright. Sample imagery is inline SVG (text) and is
# tracked normally.
#
# If you have consented demo media for a live demo, keep it OUTSIDE the repo and
# load it from disk at demo time. Do not force-add it.

*.mp4
*.m4v
*.mov
*.webm
*.avi
*.mkv
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.wav
*.aac
*.ogg
*.oga
*.opus
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.heic
*.heif
*.pdf

# Places a person's own media would land.
recordings/
uploads/
media-in/

# Portfolios exported while testing. They may contain someone's real details.
*-portfolio.html
*-portfolio.json
my-portfolio*.html
my-portfolio*.json

# Sample imagery generated from fixtures/media.js is text and IS tracked.
!fixtures/media/*.svg

node_modules/
